     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<br><br>I have a section in server.R that goes as:<br><br><br>  <div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">output$downloadReport </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> downloadHandler</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    filename </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">createOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\">$info$outputFile</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;.pdf&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> sep </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      <br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">},</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    content </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          x </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> createOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>          brewPDF</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">x</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> file</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div><br><br>The brew command takes a while -- so when you click the button, a new window opens. You then stare at a blank window for about 15 seconds until the pdf file is ready. Is there a way to get it to stay on the original window until the brew/latex/etc completes?<br><br>Thanks,<br>Greg<br></div>"
